# Rust
/target
**/target
Cargo.lock.bak

# Solana program build artifacts
*.so
programs/*/target

# Local keypairs / secrets - never commit
*.json.key
*-keypair.json
wallets/
.env
.env.*

# Local databases / notes
*.db
*.db-journal
notes/

# Soak-suite runtime state: logs, generated keypairs, notes, proof emits - never
# commit secrets. docs/PROOF.md (the committed run record) lives outside this.
.soak/
.surfpool/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
*.swp

# Trusted-setup ceremony working directories. The transcript is small and meant to
# be published, but the proving keys next to it are multi-megabyte build artifacts,
# so a whole ceremony directory stays out of git. Publish transcript.json (and the
# final transcript hash) separately.
ceremony/
*.mpk

# Circuits: build outputs and large binaries (never commit ptau/zkey/wasm)
circuits/node_modules/
circuits/*.ptau
circuits/*.zkey
circuits/*.wasm
circuits/*_js/
circuits/*.r1cs
circuits/*.sym

# Agent worktrees (never commit these)
.claude/
